flowchart TD
    A[Market Data Sources\nyfinance and Binance] --> B[AI Data Loader\nfetch_all_timeframes]
    B --> C[Feature Engineering\nbuild_dataset with technical features]
    C --> D[Model Training\nXGBoost walk-forward CV]
    D --> E[Persist Model and Metadata\nmodels/*.json]

    E --> F[Prediction Request\nBackend calls AI /predict]
    B --> F
    C --> F

    F --> G[Predictor\nSignal LONG or SHORT\nSL TP sizing context]
    G --> H[Backend stores Prediction\nstatus PENDING or AUTO_EXECUTING]

    H --> I{User Decision or Auto Mode}
    I -->|Accept| J[Backend /predictions/{id}/accept]
    I -->|Auto| K[Scheduler triggers auto execution]
    I -->|Reject| R[Prediction marked REJECTED]

    J --> L[AI /trade validation and sizing]
    K --> L

    L --> M{Execution Result}
    M -->|TRADE_EXECUTED| N[Persist Trade in DB\nstatus OPEN]
    M -->|BLOCKED or ERROR| O[Prediction updated with reason]

    N --> P[Manual Close or Rule-based Exit]
    P --> Q[Update Trade CLOSED\nCompute pnl and pnlPct\nUpdate user virtualBalance]

    Q --> S[Trade Stats and Dashboard Refresh\nREST + WebSocket]
    O --> S
    R --> S
